<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Us — Reciclaja | New & Pre-Loved Fashion</title>

  <!-- Font Awesome -->
  <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/5471644867.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>

  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,400;1,500;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>

    /* =====================================================
       DESIGN TOKENS
    ===================================================== */

    :root {
      --forest: #0d3b2e;
      --forest-2: #14523f;
      --forest-3: #1e6b52;
      --forest-soft: #2d8a6a;
      --forest-deep: #072a20;

      --emerald: #10b981;
      --emerald-soft: #34d399;

      --mango: #f59e0b;
      --mango-soft: #fbbf24;
      --mango-deep: #d97706;

      --coral: #f97362;
      --coral-soft: #fb9585;
      --coral-deep: #e05a44;

      --blush: #fef3e7;
      --blush-2: #fde8d0;

      --mint: #ecfdf5;
      --mint-2: #d1fae5;

      --lavender: #f0ebff;
      --lavender-2: #e0d5ff;

      --bg: #fbfaf7;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-2: #f7f4ee;

      --text: #10261d;
      --text-muted: #556b5f;
      --text-light: #8a9a90;

      --border: #e6e0d4;
      --border-soft: #f0ebe0;

      --radius-xl: 32px;
      --radius-lg: 24px;
      --radius: 16px;
      --radius-sm: 10px;

      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 8px 28px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.08);
      --shadow-lg: 0 20px 48px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.12);
      --shadow-glow: 0 12px 40px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18);
      --shadow-mango: 0 12px 40px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);

      --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       RESET
    ===================================================== */

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    ul { list-style: none; }

    /* =====================================================
       SCROLL PROGRESS BAR
    ===================================================== */

    .scroll-progress {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--emerald) 0%,
        var(--mango) 50%,
        var(--coral) 100%
      );
      z-index: 9999;
      transition: width 0.1s linear;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
    }

    /* =====================================================
       GLOBAL SCROLL REVEAL ANIMATIONS
    ===================================================== */

    [data-reveal] {
      opacity: 0;
      transition:
        opacity 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
        transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      will-change: opacity, transform;
    }

    [data-reveal="up"] {
      transform: translateY(50px);
    }

    [data-reveal="down"] {
      transform: translateY(-50px);
    }

    [data-reveal="left"] {
      transform: translateX(-60px);
    }

    [data-reveal="right"] {
      transform: translateX(60px);
    }

    [data-reveal="zoom"] {
      transform: scale(0.88);
    }

    [data-reveal="zoom-up"] {
      transform: scale(0.92) translateY(40px);
    }

    [data-reveal="rotate"] {
      transform: translateY(40px) rotate(-3deg);
    }

    [data-reveal].is-revealed {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1) rotate(0deg);
    }

    /* Reduced motion fallback */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      [data-reveal] {
        opacity: 1 !important;
        transform: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }

    /* =====================================================
       PAGE WRAPPER
    ===================================================== */

    .about-page {
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       HERO BANNER
    ===================================================== */

    .about-hero {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest) 0%, var(--forest-2) 50%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      padding: 90px 0 110px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      left: -10%;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .about-hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -40%;
      right: -5%;
      width: 400px;
      height: 400px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .about-hero-container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .about-hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
      color: var(--mango-soft);
      padding: 9px 20px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }

    .about-hero-eyebrow i { font-size: 12px; }

    .about-hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 72px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -2.5px;
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .about-hero h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--mango-soft) 0%, var(--coral-soft) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .about-hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #b8d4c8;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .about-hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .about-hero-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .about-hero-btn.primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--mango-soft) 100%);
      color: var(--forest);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    }

    .about-hero-btn.primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .about-hero-btn.secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .about-hero-btn.secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-color: var(--mango-soft);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    /* Floating decorations */

    .about-hero-float {
      position: absolute;
      opacity: 0.12;
      color: var(--mango-soft);
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: floatY 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .about-hero-float.f1 { top: 15%; left: 5%; font-size: 80px; animation-delay: 0s; }
    .about-hero-float.f2 { top: 60%; right: 6%; font-size: 70px; animation-delay: 2s; }
    .about-hero-float.f3 { bottom: 15%; left: 12%; font-size: 55px; animation-delay: 4s; }
    .about-hero-float.f4 { top: 25%; right: 15%; font-size: 45px; animation-delay: 1s; }

    @keyframes floatY {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-24px) rotate(8deg); }
    }

    /* =====================================================
       QUICK STATS BAR
    ===================================================== */

    .quick-stats {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 0;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 5;
      margin-top: -55px;
    }

    .quick-stats-inner {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.12);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    }

    .quick-stat {
      padding: 32px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      transition: all 0.35s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .quick-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }

    .quick-stat::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--coral) 50%, var(--emerald) 100%);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: left;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .quick-stat:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }

    .quick-stat:hover { background: var(--surface-2); }

    .quick-stat i {
      font-size: 26px;
      color: var(--mango-deep);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: transform 0.35s ease;
    }

    .quick-stat:hover i { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-6deg); }

    .quick-stat-num {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--forest);
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .quick-stat-label {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       MAIN ABOUT SECTION
    ===================================================== */

    .about-section {
      padding: 90px 0 80px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .about-container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-content { position: relative; }

    .section-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--forest-3);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 40px;
    }

    .section-eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 50%;
      width: 28px;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--coral) 100%);
      border-radius: 2px;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 46px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--forest);
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .about-content h2 em {
      font-style: italic;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--mango-deep) 0%, var(--coral) 60%, var(--mango) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .about-content .lead {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--forest-3);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .about-content p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .about-content p b { color: var(--forest); font-weight: 700; }

    /* =====================================================
       MISSION BADGE
    ===================================================== */

    .mission-badge {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mint) 0%, var(--mint-2) 100%);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 30px 32px;
      margin: 34px 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .mission-badge::before {
      content: "♻️";
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 160px;
      opacity: 0.06;
      right: -30px;
      bottom: -40px;
      transform: rotate(-15deg);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .mission-badge h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 24px;
      color: var(--forest);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .mission-badge h3 i {
      color: var(--emerald);
      font-size: 20px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    }

    .mission-badge p {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: var(--forest-3);
      line-height: 1.75;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       VALUES
    ===================================================== */

    .values-section { margin: 44px 0; }

    .values-section h3,
    .howitworks h3,
    .impact-section h3,
    .team-section h3,
    .testimonials-section h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 28px;
      color: var(--forest);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .values-section h3 i,
    .howitworks h3 i,
    .impact-section h3 i,
    .testimonials-section h3 i {
      color: var(--coral);
      font-size: 18px;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--blush) 0%, var(--blush-2) 100%);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .value-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .value-item:hover {
      border-color: var(--mango);
      transform: translateX(6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-mango);
    }

    .value-item i {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--forest-3);
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--mint) 0%, var(--mint-2) 100%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: all 0.35s ease;
    }

    .value-item:hover i {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--mango-soft) 100%);
      color: var(--forest);
      transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.05);
    }

    .value-item span {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--forest);
      letter-spacing: -0.1px;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       IMPACT SECTION
    ===================================================== */

    .impact-section { margin: 44px 0; }

    .impact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .impact-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 28px 22px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .impact-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -50%;
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      transition: all 0.5s ease;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .impact-card:hover::before { transform: scale(1.3); }

    .impact-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: var(--mint-2);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
    }

    .impact-card .impact-icon {
      font-size: 20px;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      transition: transform 0.35s ease;
    }

    .impact-card:hover .impact-icon { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-6deg); }

    .impact-card.c1 .impact-icon {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--emerald) 0%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    }

    .impact-card.c2 .impact-icon {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--coral) 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    }

    .impact-card.c3 .impact-icon {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral) 0%, var(--coral-deep) 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(249, 115, 98, 0.3);
    }

    .impact-card h4 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--forest);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .impact-card p {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       HOW IT WORKS
    ===================================================== */

    .howitworks { margin: 44px 0; }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 18px;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 24px 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .step::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 4px;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--coral) 100%);
      transform: scaleY(0);
      transform-origin: top;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .step:hover::before { transform: scaleY(1); }

    .step:hover {
      border-color: var(--mango);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-mango);
    }

    .step-num {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest) 0%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 16px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.25);
      transition: all 0.35s ease;
    }

    .step:hover .step-num {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--mango-soft) 100%);
      color: var(--forest);
      transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-6deg);
    }

    .step h4 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--forest);
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    }

    .step p {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       TEAM
    ===================================================== */

    .team-section { margin: 44px 0; }

    .team-section h3 i {
      color: var(--coral);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--lavender) 0%, var(--lavender-2) 100%);
    }

    .team-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .team-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 22px 18px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .team-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      border-color: var(--mint-2);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
    }

    .team-avatar {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.2);
      transition: transform 0.35s ease;
    }

    .team-card:hover .team-avatar { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-6deg); }

    .team-avatar.a1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--emerald) 0%, var(--forest-3) 100%); }
    .team-avatar.a2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--coral) 100%); }
    .team-avatar.a3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral) 0%, var(--coral-deep) 100%); }

    .team-card h5 {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--forest);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    }

    .team-card span {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       TESTIMONIALS
    ===================================================== */

    .testimonials-section { margin: 44px 0; }

    .testimonials-section h3 i {
      color: var(--mango-deep);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--blush) 0%, var(--blush-2) 100%);
    }

    .testimonial {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.14) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 90%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest) 0%, var(--forest-2) 60%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 38px 36px;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .testimonial::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 380px;
      height: 380px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .testimonial i.fa-quote-left {
      font-size: 30px;
      color: var(--mango-soft);
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      display: block;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .testimonial p {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #e8f0eb;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .testimonial-author {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--mango-soft);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .testimonial-author::before {
      content: "";
      width: 28px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--mango);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       CTA BANNER
    ===================================================== */

    .about-cta {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 30%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.25) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 80%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(120deg, var(--forest) 0%, var(--forest-2) 60%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 52px 48px;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 60px 0 0;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    .about-cta::before {
      content: "♻️";
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 200px;
      opacity: 0.05;
      left: -40px;
      bottom: -60px;
      transform: rotate(-15deg);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .about-cta::after {
      content: "✨";
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 140px;
      opacity: 0.05;
      right: -20px;
      top: -30px;
      transform: rotate(15deg);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .about-cta h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 40px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -1.2px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .about-cta h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--mango-soft); }

    .about-cta p {
      color: #b8d4c8;
      font-size: 15px;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .about-cta-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .about-cta-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 15px 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .about-cta-btn.primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--mango-soft) 100%);
      color: var(--forest);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
    }

    .about-cta-btn.primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.55);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .about-cta-btn.secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .about-cta-btn.secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      border-color: var(--mango-soft);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    /* =====================================================
       SOCIAL + HOME LINK
    ===================================================== */

    .about-footer-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .social-links-about {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .social-links-about a {
      background: #ffffff;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--forest);
      font-size: 17px;
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 2px solid transparent;
    }

    .social-links-about a:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.05);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .social-links-about a:nth-child(1):hover { background: #1877f2; border-color: #1877f2; }
    .social-links-about a:nth-child(2):hover { background: #1da1f2; border-color: #1da1f2; }
    .social-links-about a:nth-child(3):hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f58529 0%, #dd2a7b 50%, #8134af 100%);
      border-color: transparent;
    }
    .social-links-about a:nth-child(4):hover { background: #ff0000; border-color: #ff0000; }
    .social-links-about a:nth-child(5):hover { background: #e60023; border-color: #e60023; }

    .home-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest) 0%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.25);
    }

    .home-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px) translateX(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.35);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       STICKY IMAGE COLUMN
    ===================================================== */

    .about-image {
      position: sticky;
      top: 100px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .about-image-wrap {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .about-image-wrap::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 16px;
      left: 16px;
      right: 16px;
      bottom: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .about-image-wrap:hover { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(-1deg); }

    .about-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      object-fit: cover;
      aspect-ratio: 500 / 620;
    }

    .about-image-wrap:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }

    .image-float-badge {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 24px;
      left: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(13, 59, 46, 0.15);
      z-index: 3;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    }

    .image-float-badge i {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--emerald) 0%, var(--forest-3) 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 17px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .image-float-badge strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--forest);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.1px;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .image-float-badge span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .image-side-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .image-side-card:hover {
      transform: translateX(6px);
      border-color: var(--mango);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-mango);
    }

    .image-side-card .side-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mango) 0%, var(--coral) 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.28);
      transition: transform 0.35s ease;
    }

    .image-side-card:hover .side-icon { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-6deg); }

    .image-side-card h5 {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--forest);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    }

    .image-side-card p {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       RESPONSIVE
    ===================================================== */

    @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {

      .about-hero h1 { font-size: 58px; }

      .about-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
      }

      .about-image {
        position: relative;
        top: auto;
        max-width: 540px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .about-content h2 { font-size: 38px; }

      .quick-stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }

      .quick-stat:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }

      .quick-stat:nth-child(1),
      .quick-stat:nth-child(2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }

    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

      .about-hero { padding: 70px 0 90px; }

      .about-hero h1 { font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -1.5px; }

      .about-hero p { font-size: 15px; }

      .about-hero-float { display: none; }

      .about-hero-btn { padding: 13px 24px; font-size: 12.5px; }

      .about-section { padding: 70px 0 60px; }

      .about-content h2 { font-size: 32px; }

      .about-content .lead { font-size: 15.5px; }

      .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .impact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; }

      .team-card { padding: 18px 12px; }

      .team-avatar { width: 54px; height: 54px; font-size: 20px; }

      .team-card h5 { font-size: 12.5px; }

      .team-card span { font-size: 10px; }

      .about-cta { padding: 40px 30px; }

      .about-cta h2 { font-size: 30px; }

      .about-cta p { font-size: 14px; }

      .about-footer-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }

      .social-links-about { justify-content: center; }

      .testimonial { padding: 30px 26px; }

      .testimonial p { font-size: 15.5px; }

    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 560px) {

      .about-hero { padding: 60px 0 80px; }

      .about-hero h1 { font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -1px; }

      .about-hero-eyebrow { font-size: 10px; padding: 7px 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }

      .about-hero p { font-size: 13.5px; }

      .about-hero-btn { padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 12px; }

      .quick-stats-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .quick-stat {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
        padding: 22px 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: left;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .quick-stat:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

      .quick-stat i { margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 26px; flex-shrink: 0; }

      .quick-stat::before {
        width: 4px;
        height: 100%;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: auto; bottom: 0;
        transform: scaleY(0);
        transform-origin: top;
        transition: transform 0.4s ease;
      }

      .quick-stat:hover::before { transform: scaleY(1); }

      .about-content h2 { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.8px; }

      .about-content .lead { font-size: 14.5px; }

      .about-content p { font-size: 14px; }

      .mission-badge { padding: 24px 22px; }

      .mission-badge h3 { font-size: 19px; }

      .mission-badge h3 i { width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 16px; }

      .mission-badge p { font-size: 13.5px; }

      .values-section h3,
      .howitworks h3,
      .impact-section h3,
      .team-section h3,
      .testimonials-section h3 { font-size: 21px; }

      .values-section h3 i,
      .howitworks h3 i,
      .impact-section h3 i,
      .team-section h3 i,
      .testimonials-section h3 i { width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 15px; }

      .value-item { padding: 14px 16px; }

      .value-item span { font-size: 13px; }

      .value-item i { width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 14px; }

      .impact-card { padding: 24px 18px; }

      .step { padding: 20px 18px; gap: 14px; }

      .step h4 { font-size: 14px; }

      .step p { font-size: 12px; }

      .team-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }

      .team-card {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: left;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .team-avatar { margin: 0; flex-shrink: 0; }

      .testimonial { padding: 26px 22px; border-radius: 18px; }

      .testimonial p { font-size: 14.5px; }

      .testimonial i.fa-quote-left { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; }

      .testimonial-author { font-size: 12px; }

      .about-cta { padding: 34px 22px; border-radius: 20px; }

      .about-cta h2 { font-size: 24px; }

      .about-cta p { font-size: 13px; }

      .about-cta-btn {
        padding: 13px 22px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .social-links-about a { width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 15px; }

      .home-link {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 14px 22px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
      }

      .image-float-badge {
        padding: 12px 16px;
        gap: 12px;
        left: 16px;
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 16px;
      }

      .image-float-badge i { width: 38px; height: 38px; font-size: 15px; }

      .image-float-badge strong { font-size: 11.5px; }

      .image-float-badge span { font-size: 10px; }

      .image-side-card { padding: 18px; }

      .image-side-card .side-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 16px; }

      .image-side-card h5 { font-size: 12.5px; }

      .image-side-card p { font-size: 11px; }

    }

  </style>

  <%- include('../partials/head') %>

</head>

<body>

  <!-- =========================================================
       SCROLL PROGRESS BAR
  ========================================================== -->

  <div class="scroll-progress" id="scrollProgress"></div>


  <!-- =========================================================
       NAVBAR
  ========================================================== -->

  <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>


  <div class="about-page">

    <!-- =====================================================
         HERO BANNER
    ====================================================== -->

    <section class="about-hero">

      <i class="fas fa-tshirt about-hero-float f1"></i>
      <i class="fas fa-recycle about-hero-float f2"></i>
      <i class="fas fa-leaf about-hero-float f3"></i>
      <i class="fas fa-heart about-hero-float f4"></i>

      <div class="about-hero-container">

        <span class="about-hero-eyebrow" data-reveal="down">
          <i class="fas fa-award"></i>
          About Reciclaja
        </span>

        <h1 data-reveal="up" data-delay="100">
          Fashion that gives<br>
          <em>a second life.</em>
        </h1>

        <p data-reveal="up" data-delay="200">
          We're on a mission to make sustainable fashion the new normal —
          by connecting conscious buyers with quality new and pre-loved
          clothing that deserves to be worn again.
        </p>

        <div class="about-hero-actions" data-reveal="up" data-delay="300">

          <a href="/shop" class="about-hero-btn primary">
            <i class="fas fa-shopping-bag"></i>
            Shop Collection
          </a>

          <a href="/products/create" class="about-hero-btn secondary">
            <i class="fas fa-tag"></i>
            Start Selling
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         QUICK STATS BAR
    ====================================================== -->

    <section class="quick-stats">

      <div class="quick-stats-inner">

        <div class="quick-stat" data-reveal="up" data-delay="0">
          <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
          <div>
            <div class="quick-stat-num" data-count="25000" data-suffix="+">0</div>
            <div class="quick-stat-label">Happy Customers</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-stat" data-reveal="up" data-delay="100">
          <i class="fas fa-tshirt"></i>
          <div>
            <div class="quick-stat-num" data-count="15000" data-suffix="+">0</div>
            <div class="quick-stat-label">Items Sold</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-stat" data-reveal="up" data-delay="200">
          <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
          <div>
            <div class="quick-stat-num" data-count="2500" data-suffix=" kg">0</div>
            <div class="quick-stat-label">Textile Saved</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-stat" data-reveal="up" data-delay="300">
          <i class="fas fa-tree"></i>
          <div>
            <div class="quick-stat-num" data-count="1200" data-suffix="+">0</div>
            <div class="quick-stat-label">Trees Planted</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         MAIN ABOUT SECTION
    ====================================================== -->

    <section class="about-section">

      <div class="about-container">

        <!-- CONTENT COLUMN -->

        <div class="about-content">

          <span class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal="left">
            Our Story
          </span>

          <h2 data-reveal="left" data-delay="80">
            Where new fashion meets <em>pre-loved treasures.</em>
          </h2>

          <p class="lead" data-reveal="left" data-delay="160">
            Welcome to <b>Reciclaja</b> — your destination for conscious,
            curated fashion. We believe clothing shouldn't cost the earth,
            and that every stitch has a story worth continuing.
          </p>

          <p data-reveal="left" data-delay="240">
            Whether you're hunting for the season's freshest styles or giving
            timeless vintage pieces a second life, Reciclaja connects sellers
            and buyers who value both quality and sustainability. From crisp
            new arrivals to gently worn treasures, every item on our platform
            is verified, curated, and celebrated.
          </p>

          <p data-reveal="left" data-delay="320">
            We started in 2024 with a simple idea: what if buying clothes could
            feel good — not just for you, but for the planet? Since then, we've
            helped thousands of people refresh their wardrobes, declutter their
            closets, and reduce textile waste — one thread at a time.
          </p>

          <!-- MISSION BADGE -->

          <div class="mission-badge" data-reveal="zoom" data-delay="0">

            <h3>
              <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
              Our Promise
            </h3>

            <p>
              ♻️ 2,500+ kg of textile waste reduced &nbsp;•&nbsp;
              🌱 One item sold = one tree planted &nbsp;•&nbsp;
              🤝 100% authentic & quality checked &nbsp;•&nbsp;
              📦 Carbon-neutral shipping on all orders.
            </p>

          </div>

          <!-- VALUES -->

          <div class="values-section">

            <h3 data-reveal="left">
              <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
              What We Stand For
            </h3>

            <div class="values-grid">

              <div class="value-item" data-reveal="up" data-delay="0">
                <i class="fas fa-recycle"></i>
                <span>Circular Fashion Economy</span>
